l-Filtern mit SubAgent von CloudWeGo/Eino","Skalierung auf Null und Hibernation für eine effiziente Ressourcenverwaltung","Automatisierte Start- und Skalierungsfunktionen für eine höhere Effizienz"],"pt":["Tempo de execução elástico com gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de instâncias automatizado","Gateway unificado (mcpvmcp) para todos os servidores MCP","Filtro de ferramentas inteligente com suporte a CloudWeGo/Eino","Iniciação sob demanda e hibernação de escala zero","Gerenciamento de múltiplos servidores MCP localmente"],"ru":["Эластичное время выполнения с автоматизированным управлением инстансами","Объединенный шлюз (mcpvmcp) для всех серверов MCP","Интеллектуальный фильтр инструментов с поддержкой CloudWeGo/Eino","Запуск по требованию и масштабирование до нуля","Управление несколькими серверами MCP локально"],"ar":["وقت تشغيل مرن مع إدارة دورة حياة المثيلات التلقائية","بوابة موحدة (mcpvmcp) لجميع خادم MCP","مرشح أدوات ذكي مدعوم من CloudWeGo/Eino","تشغيل حسب الطلب وتخزين بمقياس صفر","إدارة العديد من خادم MCP محليًا"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use project-overview","project-overview alternative","project-overview install","what is project-overview","project-overview vs CloudWeGo","project-overview setup guide","Model Context Protocol server management","MCP Gateway optimization","elastic orchestrator for MCP servers"],"zh":["AI工具","模型上下文协议","弹性控制平面","自动实例生命周期管理","统一路由","智能工具过滤","CloudWeGo/Eino"],"ja":["AIエージェント","モデルコンテキストプロトコル","エラスティックコントロールプレーン","自動インスタンスライフサイクル管理","統一ルーティング","スマートツールフィルタリング","CloudWeGo/Eino"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜","엘라스틱 컨트롤 플레인","자동 인스턴스 라이프사이클 관리","통합 라우팅","스마트 툴 필터링","CloudWeGo/Eino"],"es":["project-overview","MCP Gateway","servidores de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","plan de control elástico","tiempo de ejecución elástico","gestión de instancias"," filtrado de herramientas inteligente","SubAgent","CloudWeGo/Eino","AI Agents","Herramientas de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["project-overview","MCP Gateway","serveurs de Protocole de Contexte de Modèle","plan de contrôle élastique","runtime élastique","gestion des instances","filtrage d''outils intelligent","SubAgent","CloudWeGo/Eino","Agents IA","Outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["project-overview","MCP Gateway","Model Context Protocol-Server","elastische Steuerungsebene","elastische Laufzeitumgebung","Instanzlebenszyklusverwaltung","intelligentes Tool-Filtern","SubAgent","CloudWeGo/Eino","Künstliche Intelligenz-Tools","KI-Agents"],"pt":["MCP Gateway","Elastic Orchestrator","servidores MCP","tempo de execução elástico","gerenciamento de instâncias","CloudWeGo/Eino","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","configuração de MCP"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Эластичный контрольный план","серверы MCP","время выполнения","управление инстансами","CloudWeGo/Eino","инструменты разработки","настройка ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["بوابة MCP","مراقب مرن","خادم MCP","وقت تشغيل","إدارة المثيلات","CloudWeGo/Eino","أدوات التطوير","إعداد بوابة MCP"]}},"owner":"wibus-wee","repo":"mcpv","repoPath":"wibus-wee/mcpv","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.338Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-overview","description":"Provides comprehensive overview of mcpd project architecture, capabilities, and key technical details. Use when understanding the project structure, architecture layers, or core concepts.","bodyPreview":"# mcpd Project Overview\n\n**mcpd** is an elastic control plane and runtime for Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers. It provides on-demand startup, scale-to-zero hibernation, unified routing, and intelligent tool filtering for managing multiple MCP servers locally.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n- Elastic runtime with automatic instance lifecycle management\n- Unified gateway (`mcpvmcp`) providing single entry point for all MCP servers\n- Smart SubAgent powered by CloudWeGo/Eino for context-aware tool filte","body":"# mcpd Project Overview\n\n**mcpd** is an elastic control plane and runtime for Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers. It provides on-demand startup, scale-to-zero hibernation, unified routing, and intelligent tool filtering for managing multiple MCP servers locally.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n- Elastic runtime with automatic instance lifecycle management\n- Unified gateway (`mcpvmcp`) providing single entry point for all MCP servers\n- Smart SubAgent powered by CloudWeGo/Eino for context-aware tool filtering\n- GUI support (`mcpvui`) built with Wails 3 for configuration and monitoring\n- Profile-based configuration with tag-based visibility\n- Native observability with Prometheus metrics and Grafana dashboards\n\n## Architecture\n\nThree-layer architecture for maximum decoupling:\n\n1. **Core (`mcpv`)**: Central control plane managing instance lifecycles, scheduling, and aggregation\n2. **Gateway (`mcpvmcp`)**: Protocol bridge acting as standard MCP server for AI clients\n3. **App (`mcpvui`)**: Wails-driven GUI for configuration, monitoring, and core lifecycle hosting\n\n### Internal Structure\n\n- `internal/domain/`: Domain models and interfaces (ServerSpec, Instance, Transport, Scheduler, Router, etc.)\n- `internal/app/`: Application glue layer with explicit subpackages:\n  - `controlplane/`: Control plane facade, registry/discovery/observability/automation, reload application\n  - `bootstrap/`: Bootstrap and server initialization management\n  - `catalog/`: Catalog providers and state loading\n  - `runtime/`: Runtime indexes and aggregation state\n- `internal/infra/`: Infrastructure adapters organized by concern:\n  - `catalog/`: Configuration loading and validation\n  - `scheduler/`: Instance lifecycle and capacity constraints coordination\n  - `lifecycle/`: Instance startup, handshake, and shutdown management\n  - `router/`: Request routing to managed MCP server instances\n  - `transport/`: stdio and streamable HTTP transport implementations\n  - `aggregator/`: Tool/resource/prompt aggregation and indexing\n  - `gateway/`: MCP gateway client manager and registry\n  - `subagent/`: Eino-based intelligent tool filtering\n  - `telemetry/`: Prometheus metrics and health checks\n  - `rpc/`: gRPC server and client for core-gateway communication\n- `internal/ui/`: Wails bridge layer exposing core functionality to GUI\n\n## Configuration\n\nConfiguration is YAML-based with a single file per profile. See `docs/catalog.example.yaml` or `runtime.yaml` for reference.\n\n**Key Configuration Sections**:\n- `servers[]`: MCP server definitions with transport, command, tags, lifecycle settings\n- `subAgent`: Eino-based tool filtering configuration (model, provider, API key, enabled tags)\n- `observability`: Prometheus metrics endpoint configuration\n- `rpc`: gRPC server configuration for core-gateway communication\n- Runtime settings: timeouts, concurrency limits, retry policies, bootstrap behavior\n\n**Server Configuration Example**:\n```yaml\nservers:\n  - name: my-server\n    transport: stdio\n    cmd: [node, ./path/to/server.js]\n    tags: [chat]\n    idleSeconds: 60\n    maxConcurrent: 1\n    strategy: stateless\n    activationMode: on-demand\n    protocolVersion: \"2025-11-25\"\n```\n\n**Profile System**:\n- Multiple profiles supported with caller-to-profile mapping\n- Default profile used as fallback\n- Tag-based visibility: clients see only servers matching their tags\n\n## Transport Types and Activation Modes\n\n### Transport Types\n\n**stdio** (most common):\n- Launches subprocess and communicates via stdin/stdout\n- Suitable for Node.js, Python, and other scripting languages\n- Process lifecycle managed by mcpv\n\n**streamable_http**:\n- Connects to HTTP endpoint with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming\n- Suitable for long-running HTTP services\n- No process management needed\n\n**composite**:\n- Advanced use case combining multiple transports\n- Rarely needed\n\n### Activation Modes\n\n**on-demand** (default):\n- Instances start when first request arrives\n- Ideal for resource efficiency\n- Cold start latency on first request\n\n**always-on**:\n- Keeps `minReady` instances running at all times\n- Use for latency-sensitive servers\n- Higher resource usage\n\n**disabled**:\n- Server defined but not activated\n- Useful for testing or staged rollouts\n\n### Server Strategies\n\n**stateless**:\n- Requests can be routed to any available instance\n- Instances can be freely started/stopped\n- Most common and efficient\n\n**stateful**:\n- Router maintains sticky sessions\n- Requests from same client go to same instance\n- Session expires after client inactivity timeout\n\n### Gateway Behavior\n\nThe `mcpvmcp` gateway:\n- Registers with core on startup via gRPC\n- Maintains persistent connection to core\n- Translates MCP JSON-RPC to core''s internal protocol\n- Handles tool/resource/prompt aggregation\n- Supports both single-server and tag-based modes\n\n### Flags\n\n- `--config`: Specify config directory (default: current directory)\n- `--rpc`: Override RPC address for gateway\n- `--tag`: Filter servers by tag in gateway mode\n- `--server`: Single-server mode for gateway\n\n## Key Technical Details\n\n### Hot Reload\n\nThe core watches the config directory for changes and automatically reloads:\n- Server spec additions/removals\n- Configuration updates\n- Profile changes\n- Active instances are gracefully drained before applying changes\n\n### Concurrency Control\n\n- `maxConcurrent`: Maximum parallel requests per instance\n- `minReady`: Minimum instances to keep warm\n- Scheduler spawns new instances when capacity is reached\n- Instances are reused across requests (connection pooling)\n\n### Tool Namespace Strategy\n\nTo avoid tool name collisions across servers:\n- **prefix**: Tools named as `server__toolname` (default)\n- **suffix**: Tools named as `toolname__server`\n\n### Bootstrap Modes\n\n- **metadata**: Only fetch server metadata (tools/resources/prompts) on startup\n- **full**: Perform full initialization including handshake\n- **none**: Skip bootstrap entirely\n\n### Scale-to-Zero Runtime\n\nInstances are launched on-demand and shut down after idle timeout:\n- Scheduler manages instance pools with concurrency limits\n- Router maintains session affinity for stateful servers\n- Lifecycle manager handles startup, handshake, and graceful shutdown\n- Probe system monitors instance health\n\n### Tool Aggregation\n\nThe aggregator maintains a unified index across all active instances:\n- Automatic refresh on `list_changed` notifications\n- Concurrent refresh workers with rate limiting\n- Namespace strategy (prefix or suffix) to avoid tool name collisions\n- Supports tools, resources, and prompts\n\n## Version Information\n\n- **Go**: 1.25+\n- **Wails**: 3.0.0-alpha.53\n- **MCP SDK**: github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk v1.2.0\n- **Eino**: github.com/cloudwego/eino v0.7.15\n- **Prometheus**: github.com/prometheus/client_golang v1.23.2\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- **MCP Specification**: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/\n- **Wails Documentation**: https://wails.io/\n- **Wire Documentation**: https://github.com/google/wire\n- **CloudWeGo Eino**: https://github.com/cloudwego/eino\n- **Frontend Guide**: See `frontend/CLAUDE.md` for React/TypeScript frontend development\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:22.374Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Model Context Protocol Agents requiring elastic runtime management and unified routing for multiple MCP servers.","zh":"适用于需要弹性运行时管理和多个MCP服务器统一路由的Model Context Protocol Agents。","ja":"Model Context Protocol Agentsが弹性ランタイム管理と複数のMCPサーバーの統一ルーティングを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"elastic runtime 관리와 여러 MCP 서버에 대한統一ルーティング이 필요한 Model Context Protocol Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo que requieren una gestión de tiempo de ejecución elástica y una ruta unificada para varios servidores MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Protocole de Contexte de Modèle nécessitant une gestion de runtime élastique et un routage unifié pour plusieurs serveurs MCP.","de":"Ideal für Model Context Protocol Agents, die eine elastische Laufzeitverwaltung und ein einheitliches Routing für mehrere MCP-Server erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo que requerem gerenciamento de tempo de execução elástico e roteamento unificado para vários servidores MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов протокола контекста модели, требующих эластичного управления временем выполнения и объединенного маршрутизации для нескольких серверов MCP.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل بروتوكول سياق النموذج التي تتطلب إدارة وقت التشغيل المرن والتوجيه الموحد للخادمات MCP المتعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage MCP servers with automatic instance lifecycle management, unified gateway via mcpvmcp, and intelligent tool filtering powered by CloudWeGo/Eino, leveraging the Model Context Protocol for seamless interactions.","zh":"赋予代理管理MCP服务器的能力，具有自动实例生命周期管理、通过mcpvmcp的统一网关和由CloudWeGo/Eino提供支持的智能工具过滤，利用Model Context Protocol实现无缝交互。","ja":"エージェントにMCPサーバーを管理する機能を与え、自動インスタンスライフサイクル管理、mcpvmcp経由の統一ゲートウェイ、およびCloudWeGo/Einoによって提供されるインテリジェントツールフィルタリングを提供し、Model Context Protocolを使用してシームレスな相互作用を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에 MCP 서버를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며 자동 인스턴스 수명 주기 관리, mcpvmcp를 통한統一 게이트웨이 및 CloudWeGo/Eino에서 제공하는 지능형 도구 필터링을 제공하며 Model Context Protocol을 사용하여無縫な 상호 작용을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar servidores MCP con administración automática del ciclo de vida de instancias, puerta de enlace unificada a través de mcpvmcp y filtrado de herramientas inteligentes impulsado por CloudWeGo/Eino, aprovechando el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para interacciones sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les serveurs MCP avec une gestion automatique du cycle de vie des instances, une passerelle unifiée via mcpvmcp et un filtrage d''outils intelligent grâce à CloudWeGo/Eino, en exploitant le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle pour des interactions sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, MCP-Server mit automatischer Instanzlebenszyklusverwaltung, einheitlicher Gateway über mcpvmcp und intelligenter Werkzeugfilterung, die von CloudWeGo/Eino angetrieben wird, zu verwalten, indem sie das Model Context Protocol für nahtlose Interaktionen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar servidores MCP com gerenciamento automatizado do ciclo de vida da instância, gateway unificado via mcpvmcp e filtragem de ferramentas inteligentes impulsionada por CloudWeGo/Eino, aproveitando o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para interações sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять серверами MCP с автоматизированным управлением жизненным циклом экземпляра, объединенным шлюзом через mcpvmcp и интеллектуальной фильтрацией инструментов на основе CloudWeGo/Eino, используя Протокол контекста модели для бесперебойного взаимодействия.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة خوادم MCP مع إدارة دورة حياة Instance تلقائية، وبوابة موحدة عبر mcpvmcp، وتصفية أدوات ذكية مدعومة من CloudWeGo/Eino، مستفيدا من بروتوكول سياق النموذج من أجل التفاعلات السلسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating MCP server startup and hibernation","Unifying routing for multiple MCP servers","Filtering tools with context-aware SubAgents"],"zh":["自动化MCP服务器启动和休眠","统一多个MCP服务器的路由","使用上下文感知的SubAgents过滤工具"],"ja":["MCPサーバーの自動起動と休眠","複数のMCPサーバーのルーティングの統一","コンテキスト認識SubAgentsを使用したツールのフィルタリング"],"ko":["MCP 서버의 자동 시작 및 휴면","여러 MCP 서버의 루팅統一","컨텍스트 인식 SubAgents를 사용한 도구 필터링"],"es":["Automatizar el arranque y la hibernación de servidores MCP","Unificar el enrutamiento para varios servidores MCP","Filtrar herramientas con SubAgents conscientes del contexto"],"fr":["Automatiser le démarrage et l''hibernation de serveurs MCP","Unifier le routage pour plusieurs serveurs MCP","Filtrer les outils avec des SubAgents sensibles au contexte"],"de":["Automatisieren des Startens und des Ruhezustands von MCP-Servern","Einheitliches Routing für mehrere MCP-Server","Filtern von Tools mit kontextbewussten SubAgents"],"pt":["Automatizar a inicialização e hibernação do servidor MCP","Unificar o roteamento para vários servidores MCP","Filtrar ferramentas com SubAgentes com conscientização de contexto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запуск и спячку сервера MCP","Объединить маршрутизацию для нескольких серверов MCP","Фильтровать инструменты с помощью SubAgentов с контекстно-зависимой осведомленностью"],"ar":["تأتمتة تشغيل وسبات خادم MCP","توحيد التوجيه للخادمات MCP المتعددة","تصفية الأدوات مع SubAgents ذات الوعي السياقي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local MCP server setup","Dependent on CloudWeGo/Eino for SubAgent functionality"],"zh":["需要本地MCP服务器设置","依赖于CloudWeGo/Eino进行SubAgent功能"],"ja":["ローカルMCPサーバーの設定が必要","SubAgentの機能にはCloudWeGo/Einoに依存"],"ko":["로컬 MCP 서버 설정이 필요","SubAgent 기능은 CloudWeGo/Eino에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración local de servidor MCP","Dependiente de CloudWeGo/Eino para la funcionalidad de SubAgent"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration locale de serveur MCP","Dépendant de CloudWeGo/Eino pour la fonctionnalité de SubAgent"],"de":["Benötigt lokale MCP-Server-Konfiguration","Abhängig von CloudWeGo/Eino für die SubAgent-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer configuração local do servidor MCP","Dependente do CloudWeGo/Eino para funcionalidade do SubAgent"],"ru":["Требует локальной настройки сервера MCP","Зависит от CloudWeGo/Eino для функциональности SubAgent"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم MCP المحلي","يعتمد على CloudWeGo/Eino لتوظيف SubAgent"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4ef9270502ad0f209e185d37768b86c1934df28629f399d71b654274b2929209","qualityScore":39}');
