hain, comprising an indexer, API, Telegram bot, and mini-app for real-time performance tracking.","zh":"GitHub Issue AIエージェント工具是一种创建和管理GitHub问题的工具，用于实现实时验证器性能、奖励和警报","ja":"GitHub Issue AIエージェントは、GitHubの問題を作成および管理するためのツールであり、外部貢献者が実装できる単一の明確な目標を持つ問題を作成するために使用されます","ko":"GitHub Issue AI 에이전트는 GitHub 문제를 생성 및 관리하는 도구로, 외부 기여자가 구현할 수 있는 단일의 명확한 목표를 갖는 문제를 생성하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"github-issue es una herramienta de validación ligera para la cadena de beacon que crea problemas de GitHub autocontenidos","fr":"github-issue est un outil de validation léger pour la chaîne de beacon qui crée des problèmes GitHub autocontenus","de":"github-issue ist ein leichtes Validierungstool für die Beacon-Kette, das selbstenthaltene GitHub-Probleme erstellt","pt":"O github-issue é uma ferramenta de validação de desempenho de validadores para a Beacon Chain.","ru":"ИИ Агент github-issue - это инструмент для мониторинга производительности валидаторов для Beacon Chain.","ar":"github-issue هو أداة للتحقق من أداء المصادقين لسلاسل البوصلة."},"features":{"en":["Creates single, clear-goal GitHub issues for external contributors","Generates epics with sub-issues for multi-layered work requests","Monitors validator performance on the beacon chain using an indexer and API","Provides real-time alerts and rewards via a Telegram bot and mini-app","Enforces scope boundaries to prevent feature creep","Utilizes a decision flow to determine issue creation"],"zh":["创建专注、自成体系的GitHub问题","实现实时验证器性能、奖励和警报","使用Decision Flow创建单一的明确目标","支持Spans多个层级的创建","使用Scope Boundaries确保问题范围的明确性"],"ja":["単一の明確な目標を持つGitHubの問題を作成","外部貢献者が実装できる問題を作成","Decision Flowを使用して問題を作成","Spans多个层级の問題を作成","Scope Boundariesを使用して問題の範囲を明確にする"],"ko":["단일의 명확한 목표를 갖는 GitHub 문제를 생성","외부 기여자가 구현할 수 있는 문제를 생성","Decision Flow를 사용하여 문제를 생성","Spans 다중 계층의 문제를 생성","Scope Boundaries를 사용하여 문제 범위를 명확히 함"],"es":["Creación de problemas de GitHub enfocados y autocontenidos","Indexer para la cadena de beacon","API para acceso a datos","Bot de Telegram para notificaciones en tiempo real","Estructura de decisión para la creación de problemas"],"fr":["Création de problèmes GitHub ciblés et autocontenus","Indexer pour la chaîne de beacon","API pour accéder aux données","Bot Telegram pour les notifications en temps réel","Structure de décision pour la création de problèmes"],"de":["Erstellung fokussierter und selbstenthaltener GitHub-Probleme","Indexer für die Beacon-Kette","API für den Zugriff auf Daten","Telegram-Bot für Echtzeitbenachrichtigungen","Entscheidungsstruktur für die Erstellung von Problemen"],"pt":["Indexer para monitoramento de desempenho de validadores","API para integração com outras ferramentas","Bot do Telegram para alertas em tempo real","Criador de issues do GitHub para problemas de validação","Epic com sub-issues para gerenciamento de problemas","Decisão de fluxo para criação de issues claras e concisas"],"ru":["Индексирование для мониторинга производительности валидаторов","API для интеграции с другими инструментами","Telegram-бот для реальных уведомлений","Создатель проблем GitHub для проблем валидации","Эпическая задача с подзадачами для управления проблемами","Потоковое решение для создания ясных и кратких проблем"],"ar":["فهرسة لمتابعة أداء المصادقين","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لتكامل مع أدوات أخرى","бот التليجرام لتنبيهات الوقت الفعلي","مُنشئ مشاكل جيثب لمشاكل التحقق","مهمة ملحمية مع مهام فرعية لإدارة المشاكل","قرار تدفق لإنشاء مشاكل واضحة وموجزة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use github-issue","github-issue setup guide","github-issue alternative","github-issue vs validator monitor","creating focused github issues","beacon chain validator performance","github-issue install","github-issue for developers","github-issue for ai agents","validator monitor for beacon chain"],"zh":["GitHub Issue","AIエージェント工具","实时验证器性能","奖励和警报","Decision Flow","Scope Boundaries","GitHub问题创建","外部貢献者","单一的明确目标"],"ja":["GitHub Issue","AIエージェント","外部貢献者","単一の明確な目標","Decision Flow","Scope Boundaries","GitHubの問題を作成","Spans多个层级","問題の範囲を明確にする"],"ko":["GitHub Issue","AI 에이전트","외부 기여자","단일의 명확한 목표","Decision Flow","Scope Boundaries","GitHub 문제 생성","Spans 다중 계층","문제 범위를 명확히 함"],"es":["github-issue","problemas de GitHub","indexer de beacon","API de GitHub","bot de Telegram","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","github para desarrolladores"],"fr":["github-issue","problèmes GitHub","indexer de beacon","API GitHub","bot Telegram","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","github pour les développeurs"],"de":["github-issue","GitHub-Probleme","Beacon-Indexer","GitHub-API","Telegram-Bot","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","github für Entwickler"],"pt":["github-issue","Beacon Chain","validação de desempenho","indexer","API","Telegram bot","criador de issues","gerenciamento de problemas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент github-issue","Beacon Chain","мониторинг производительности","индексирование","API","Telegram-бот","создатель проблем","управление проблемами","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["github-issue","سلاسل البوصلة","التحقق من الأداء","الفهرسة","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","бот التليجرام","مُنشئ مشاكل","إدارة المشاكل","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"NodeSentinel","repo":"beacon-chain-validators-monitor","repoPath":"NodeSentinel/beacon-chain-validators-monitor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.349Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-issue","description":"Use when creating GitHub issues, breaking down work into issues, or when asked to file a bug report or feature request","bodyPreview":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\nCreate focused, self-contained GitHub issues that an external contributor could implement without additional context.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nWork requested\n    │\n    ▼\nSingle clear goal? ──yes──> Create single issue\n    │\n    no\n    │\n    ▼\nSpans multiple layers? ──yes──> Create epic with sub-issues\n```\n\n## Scope Boundaries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Stick to what was requested.** Create issues ONLY for the requested feature. Do NOT expand into adjacent features.\n\nWhen Feature X dep","body":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\nCreate focused, self-contained GitHub issues that an external contributor could implement without additional context.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nWork requested\n    │\n    ▼\nSingle clear goal? ──yes──> Create single issue\n    │\n    no\n    │\n    ▼\nSpans multiple layers? ──yes──> Create epic with sub-issues\n```\n\n## Scope Boundaries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Stick to what was requested.** Create issues ONLY for the requested feature. Do NOT expand into adjacent features.\n\nWhen Feature X depends on Feature Y:\n\n- Create minimal stub for Y (just enough to unblock X)\n- ASK user if they want a separate epic for Y\n\n**ASK before proceeding when:**\n\n1. Adjacent features detected\n2. Ambiguous boundaries\n3. Multiple interpretations possible\n4. Feature seems too large (10+ issues)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Clarify Scope\n\nASK user about boundaries before drafting.\n\n### 2. Review Preference\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion`:\n\n- **\"Review first\" (Recommended)**: Create preview file in scratchpad for feedback before creating issues\n- **\"Create directly\"**: Create issues immediately with `needs-review` label added via `gh issue edit <num> --add-label \"needs-review\"` after creation\n\n### 3. Create Issues (Single Script)\n\nUse GraphQL API for reliable creation (see `./graphql-api.md`).\n\n**CRITICAL**: Execute ALL operations in a SINGLE bash script to minimize permission prompts. This includes:\n\n1. Getting repo info\n2. Getting repo ID\n3. Creating epic\n4. Creating all sub-issues\n5. Linking sub-issues to epic\n6. Adding labels\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ALL OPERATIONS IN ONE SCRIPT - Single permission prompt\n\nset -e\n\n# 1. Get repo info\nREPO=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner -q .nameWithOwner)\nOWNER=$(echo \"$REPO\" | cut -d''/'' -f1)\nNAME=$(echo \"$REPO\" | cut -d''/'' -f2)\n\n# 2. Get repo ID\nREPO_ID=$(gh api graphql -f query=\"query { repository(owner: \\\"$OWNER\\\", name: \\\"$NAME\\\") { id } }\" -q ''.data.repository.id'')\n\n# 3. Create epic\nEPIC=$(gh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation($repoId: ID!, $title: String!, $body: String!) {\n  createIssue(input: { repositoryId: $repoId, title: $title, body: $body }) {\n    issue { number id }\n  }\n}'' -f repoId=\"$REPO_ID\" -f title=\"[Context] Epic: Feature Name\" -f body=\"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Objective\nEpic description here...\n\n## Sub-Issues\n- [ ] Sub-issue 1\n- [ ] Sub-issue 2\nEOF\n)\")\nEPIC_NUM=$(echo \"$EPIC\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.number'')\nEPIC_ID=$(echo \"$EPIC\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.id'')\n\n# 4. Create sub-issues\nISSUE1=$(gh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation($repoId: ID!, $title: String!, $body: String!) {\n  createIssue(input: { repositoryId: $repoId, title: $title, body: $body }) {\n    issue { number id }\n  }\n}'' -f repoId=\"$REPO_ID\" -f title=\"[Context] Sub-issue 1\" -f body=\"Issue body...\")\nISSUE1_NUM=$(echo \"$ISSUE1\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.number'')\nISSUE1_ID=$(echo \"$ISSUE1\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.id'')\n\n# Continue for all sub-issues...\n\n# 5. Link sub-issues (attempt - may not be available on all repos)\ngh api graphql \\\n  -H \"GraphQL-Features: sub_issues\" \\\n  -f query=''mutation($parentId: ID!, $childId: ID!) {\n    addSubIssue(input: { issueId: $parentId, subIssueId: $childId }) {\n      issue { number }\n    }\n  }'' \\\n  -f parentId=\"$EPIC_ID\" \\\n  -f childId=\"$ISSUE1_ID\" 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 6. Add labels\nfor issue in $EPIC_NUM $ISSUE1_NUM; do\n  gh issue edit \"$issue\" --add-label \"needs-review\" --repo \"$REPO\" 2>/dev/null || true\ndone\n\necho \"Created Epic #$EPIC_NUM with sub-issues\"\n```\n\n## Issue Structure\n\n### Title Convention\n\nIssue titles MUST include context prefix from the user''s request. Extract the context (e.g., \"Seller\", \"Buyer\", \"Payments\") and prefix all issues:\n\n```\n[Context] Issue title\n```\n\nExamples:\n\n- User asks: \"create issues for the Seller\" → `[Seller] Seller Registration`, `[Seller] Create Product Listing`\n- User asks: \"create issues for checkout flow\" → `[Checkout] Cart Summary`, `[Checkout] Payment Processing`\n- Epic title: `[Seller] Epic: Seller Experience`\n\n### Required Sections\n\nEvery issue MUST include:\n\n| Section                 | Purpose                           |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Objective**           | Single, clear goal (one sentence) |\n| **Scope**               | What''s included                   |\n| **Acceptance Criteria** | Checkboxes for \"done\"             |\n| **Out of Scope**        | Explicit boundaries               |\n| **How to Test**         | Verification steps                |\n\nOptional: Examples, Technical Notes, Dependencies, Related\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake                          | Fix                                   |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Vague objective                  | Specific goal with measurable outcome |\n| Missing acceptance criteria      | Add checkboxes                        |\n| Expanding into adjacent features | ASK if separate epic needed           |\n| Using only labels to link issues | Use GraphQL `addSubIssue`             |\n\n## Reference Files\n\nLoad these on-demand as needed:\n\n- `./graphql-api.md` - GraphQL mutations for creating issues and sub-issues (RECOMMENDED)\n- `./cli-reference.md` - Quick gh CLI commands reference\n- `./templates.md` - Issue body templates and examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:42.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing automated GitHub issue creation and beacon chain monitoring.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 GitHub 问题创建和信标链监控的 Developer Agents。","ja":"GitHub の問題作成とビーコンチェーンの監視を自動化する必要がある Developer Agents に最適です。","ko":"GitHub 문제 생성 및 비콘 체인 모니터링을 자동화해야 하는 Developer Agents 에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan la creación automática de problemas de GitHub y monitoreo de cadena de faros.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant la création automatisée de problèmes GitHub et la surveillance de la chaîne de balises.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die die automatisierte Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen und die Überwachung der Leuchtturmkette benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que precisam de criação automatizada de problemas do GitHub e monitoramento da cadeia de faróis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработчиков, которым требуется автоматизированное создание проблем GitHub и мониторинг бейкон-чейна.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مشاكل GitHub آلي وتحديد موقع سلسلة المنارة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create focused, self-contained GitHub issues with real-time alerts and rewards, utilizing decision flows and scope boundaries to ensure clear goals and minimal context, while monitoring validator performance on the beacon chain via GitHub APIs and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建专注、自成体系的 GitHub 问题的能力，具有实时警报和奖励，利用决策流程和范围边界确保清晰的目标和最小的上下文，同时通过 GitHub APIs 和协议监控信标链上的验证器性能。","ja":"エージェントに、リアルタイムのアラートや報酬を利用して、焦点を当てたセルフコンテイニングの GitHub の問題を作成する能力を与え、意思決定フローとスコープの境界を使用して、明確な目標と最小限のコンテキストを確保しながら、GitHub API やプロトコル経由でビーコンチェーンの検証器のパフォーマンスを監視します。","ko":"에이전트가 집중적이고 자체 포함된 GitHub 문제를 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 실시간 알림 및 보상을 사용하며, 결정 흐름 및 범위 경계를 사용하여 명확한 목표 및 최소한의 컨텍스트를 보장하면서 GitHub API 및 프로토콜을 통해 비콘 체인의 검증기 성능을 모니터링합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear problemas de GitHub enfocados y autocontenidos con alertas y recompensas en tiempo real, utilizando flujos de decisión y límites de alcance para garantizar objetivos claros y un contexto mínimo, mientras se monitorea el rendimiento de los validadores en la cadena de faros a través de GitHub APIs y protocolos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des problèmes GitHub ciblés et auto-contenus avec des alertes et des récompenses en temps réel, en utilisant des flux de décision et des limites de portée pour garantir des objectifs clairs et un contexte minimal, tout en surveillant les performances des validateurs sur la chaîne de balises via les API et les protocoles GitHub.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, fokussierte, selbstenthaltene GitHub-Probleme mit Echtzeit-Alerts und Belohnungen zu erstellen, indem Entscheidungsflüsse und Umfangsgrenzen verwendet werden, um klare Ziele und minimalen Kontext sicherzustellen, während die Leistung der Validatoren in der Leuchtturmkette über GitHub-APIs und -Protokolle überwacht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar problemas do GitHub focados e autocontidos com alertas e recompensas em tempo real, utilizando fluxos de decisão e limites de escopo para garantir metas claras e contexto mínimo, enquanto monitora o desempenho do validador na cadeia de faróis via GitHub APIs e protocolos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сосредоточенные, самодостаточные проблемы GitHub с реальными оповещениями и вознаграждениями, используя потоки решений и границы области действия для обеспечения четких целей и минимального контекста, а также отслеживает производительность валидатора в бейкон-чейне через GitHub API и протоколы.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مشاكل GitHub محددة ومتكاملة مع تنبيهات و مكافآت في الوقت الفعلي، باستخدام تدفقات القرار وحدود النطاق لضمان أهداف واضحة وسياق أدنى، في حين مراقبة أداء المُصادق على سلسلة المنارة عبر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات GitHub وبروتوكولاتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitHub issue creation for external contributors","Monitoring validator performance on the beacon chain","Generating epic issues with sub-issues for complex features","Creating single issues for clear, self-contained goals"],"zh":["为外部贡献者自动化 GitHub 问题创建","监控信标链上的验证器性能","为复杂功能生成带有子问题的史诗问题","为清晰、自成体系的目标创建单个问题"],"ja":["外部貢献者のための GitHub の問題作成の自動化","ビーコンチェーン上の検証器のパフォーマンスの監視","複雑な機能のためのエピック問題の生成とサブ問題","明確でセルフコンテイニングされた目標のための単一の問題作成"],"ko":["외부 기여자를 위한 GitHub 문제 생성 자동화","비콘 체인上的 검증기 성능 모니터링","복잡한 기능을 위한 에픽 이슈 생성 및 하위 이슈","명확하고 자체 포함된 목표를 위한 단일 이슈 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de GitHub para contribuyentes externos","Monitoreo del rendimiento de los validadores en la cadena de faros","Generación de problemas épico con subproblemas para características complejas","Creación de problemas únicos para objetivos claros y autocontenidos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes GitHub pour les contributeurs externes","Surveillance des performances des validateurs sur la chaîne de balises","Génération de problèmes épiques avec des sous-problèmes pour des fonctionnalités complexes","Création de problèmes uniques pour des objectifs clairs et auto-contenus"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen für externe Mitwirkende","Überwachung der Leistung der Validatoren in der Leuchtturmkette","Erzeugung von epischen Problemen mit Unterproblemen für komplexe Funktionen","Erstellung von einzelnen Problemen für klare, selbstenthaltene Ziele"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas do GitHub para contribuidores externos","Monitorar o desempenho do validador na cadeia de faróis","Gerar problemas épico com subproblemas para recursos complexos","Criar problemas únicos para metas claras e autocontidas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем GitHub для внешних участников","Отслеживать производительность валидатора в бейкон-чейне","Генерировать эпические проблемы с подзадачами для сложных функций","Создавать единственные проблемы для четких, самодостаточных целей"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإنشاء مشاكل GitHub للمساهمين الخارجيين","مراقبة أداء المُصادق على سلسلة المنارة","توليد مشاكل ملحمية مع مشاكل فرعية لمميزات معقدة","إنشاء مشاكل فردية لأهداف واضحة ومتكاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Limited to creating issues for requested features only","Dependent on beacon chain data for validator performance monitoring"],"zh":["需要 GitHub API 访问","仅限创建针对请求功能的问题","依赖信标链数据进行验证器性能监控"],"ja":["GitHub API アクセスが必要","リクエストされた機能のみの問題作成に限定","ビーコンチェーンのデータに依存して検証器のパフォーマンスを監視"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요합니다.","요청된 기능만的问题 생성으로 제한됩니다.","비콘 체인 데이터에 의존하여 검증기 성능을 모니터링"],"es":["Requiere acceso a GitHub API","Limitado a la creación de problemas para características solicitadas solo","Dependiente de los datos de la cadena de faros para la supervisión del rendimiento de los validadores"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Limité à la création de problèmes pour les fonctionnalités demandées uniquement","Dépendant des données de la chaîne de balises pour la surveillance des performances des validateurs"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Problemen für angeforderte Funktionen nur","Abhängig von den Daten der Leuchtturmkette für die Überwachung der Leistung der Validatoren"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do GitHub","Limitado à criação de problemas para recursos solicitados apenas","Dependente dos dados da cadeia de faróis para monitoramento do desempenho do validador"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API GitHub","Ограничен созданием проблем только для запрошенных функций","Зависит от данных бейкон-чейна для мониторинга производительности валидатора"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","محدود بإنشاء مشاكل لمميزات المطلوبة فقط","يعتمد على بيانات سلسلة المنارة لمراقبة أداء المُصادق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"37e77cc45a1ecf136420807eeca519987cab5bbea1c33dabb68771c89c2f09e8","qualityScore":39}');
