INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('hookvibe/hookcode/hookcode-preview-highlight', 'hookcode-preview-highlight', 'hookvibe', 'hookcode', 'community', 'hookcode-preview-highlight hookvibe hookcode community hookcode-preview-highlight is a skill that ships JS request scripts for preview highlight flow, supporting independent deployment and real-time task execution monitoring. It benefits developers by automating code review and testing. HookCode预览高亮是一个智能代码审查和自动化平台，支持独立部署和实时任务执行监控 HookCodeプレビューハイライトは、インテリジェントなコードレビューと自動化プラットフォームで、独立したデプロイとリアルタイムのタスク実行モニタリングをサポートします HookCode预览 하이라이트는 지능형 코드 리뷰 및 자동화 플랫폼으로 독립 배포 및 실시간 작업 실행 모니터링을 지원합니다 Hookcode-preview-highlight es una habilidad que permite a los desarrolladores ejecutar flujos de trabajo de código inteligente con CLI y Webhooks Hookcode-preview-highlight est une compétence qui permet aux développeurs d''exécuter des flux de travail de code intelligent avec CLI et Webhooks Hookcode-preview-highlight ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, intelligente Code-Workflows mit CLI und Webhooks auszuführen O Hookcode Preview Highlight é uma plataforma de revisão e automação de código que utiliza assistentes de codificação CLI e Webhooks para automatizar tarefas de codificação Hookcode Preview Highlight — платформа для автоматизации и проверки кода, которая использует CLI-ассистенты и Webhooks для автоматизации задач кодирования Hookcode Preview Highlight هو منصة مراجعة وآتمتة الكود التي تستخدم مساعدي الترميز CLI والويب هوك لآتمتة المهام البرمجية how to use hookcode-preview-highlight hookcode-preview-highlight setup guide hookcode-preview-highlight alternative hookcode-preview-highlight vs automation platforms hookcode-preview-highlight install what is hookcode-preview-highlight hookcode-preview-highlight for AI agents CLI coding assistants with hookcode-preview-highlight Webhooks and hookcode-preview-highlight integration HookCode预览高亮 AI工具 CLI编码辅助 Webhooks JS请求脚本 依赖安装 跨域桥接 实时任务执行监控 Ships JS request scripts with .env loading for preview highlight flow Supports independent deployment for flexible integration Provides real-time task execution monitoring through a visual console Triggers CLI coding assistants through conversations and Webhooks Includes protocol notes for cross-origin bridge handshake Installs dependencies and sends highlight commands for streamlined testing hookcode-preview-highlight is a skill that enables automated code review and preview highlighting through CLI coding assistants and Webhooks, with features like .env loading and protocol notes.');
