رياكت"},"description":{"en":"Unlock faster rendering with React-Performance! Discover how to memoize expensive computations and optimize lists for a seamless user experience. Get started...","zh":"了解React性能优化技巧，包括memoization和useMemo，优化您的React应用","ja":"Reactパフォーマンス最適化のテクニックを学び、メモ化とuseMemoを使用してReactアプリを最適化する","ko":"React 성능 최적화 기술을 알아보고, 메모화와 useMemo를 사용하여 React 애플리케이션을 최적화하세요","es":"Aprende a mejorar el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones React con técnicas de memoización y optimización de listas","fr":"Améliorez les performances de vos applications React avec des techniques de mémorisation et d''optimisation de listes","de":"Verbessern Sie die Leistung Ihrer React-Anwendungen mit Memoisierungstechniken und Liste-Optimierungen","pt":"Aprenda a melhorar o desempenho do seu aplicativo React com técnicas de memoização e otimização de lista","ru":"Узнайте, как улучшить производительность вашего приложения React с помощью мемоизации и оптимизации списка","ar":"تعلم كيفية تحسين أداء تطبيق رياكت باستخدام تقنيات التذكير والتối ưuية للقائمة"},"definition":{"en":"React-performance is a set of techniques and patterns for improving the rendering speed and efficiency of React applications, including memoization and optimization of lists and computations.","zh":"React性能优化是指通过优化React应用的渲染和计算过程来提高应用的性能","ja":"Reactパフォーマンス最適化は、Reactアプリのレンダリングと計算プロセスを最適化してアプリのパフォーマンスを向上させること","ko":"React 성능 최적화는 React 애플리케이션의 렌더링과 계산 과정을 최적화하여 애플리케이션의 성능을 향상시키는 것","es":"React Performance se refiere a la optimización del rendimiento de aplicaciones React","fr":"Les performances de React font référence à l''optimisation des applications React","de":"React-Performance bezeichnet die Optimierung der Leistung von React-Anwendungen","pt":"Otimização de desempenho do React é a prática de melhorar a eficiência do seu aplicativo","ru":"Оптимизация производительности React - это практика улучшения эффективности вашего приложения","ar":"تحسين أداء رياكت هو ممارسة تحسين كفاءة تطبيقك"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes useMemo for memoizing expensive calculations","Optimizes lists through filtering and sorting","Minimizes unnecessary re-renders for faster rendering","Improves application performance through efficient computation handling","Applies memoization patterns for optimized rendering behavior","Supports optimized rendering for complex React components"],"zh":["使用memoization优化React组件","使用useMemo优化昂贵的计算","理解React的渲染行为","优化React列表和表格","减少不必要的重新渲染"],"ja":["メモ化を使用してReactコンポーネントを最適化","useMemoを使用して高価な計算を最適化","Reactのレンダリングの動作を理解","Reactリストとテーブルを最適化","不必要な再レンダリングを減らす"],"ko":["메모화를 사용하여 React 컴포넌트를 최적화","useMemo를 사용하여 비싼 계산을 최적화","React의 렌더링 동작을 이해","React 목록과 테이블을 최적화","불필요한 재렌더링을 줄임"],"es":["Técnicas de memoización con useMemo","Optimización de listas con filter y sort","Evitación de re-renders innecesarios","Uso de computaciones en segundo plano","Mejora del rendimiento de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Techniques de mémorisation avec useMemo","Optimisation de listes avec filter et sort","Évitement de re-renders inutiles","Utilisation de calculs en arrière-plan","Amélioration des performances d''applications web"],"de":["Memoisierungstechniken mit useMemo","Liste-Optimierungen mit filter und sort","Vermeidung von unnötigen Re-renders","Verwendung von Hintergrundberechnungen","Leistungsverbesserung von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Uso de memoização com useMemo","Otimização de listas com técnicas de filtragem e ordenação","Evitar re-renders desnecessários","Expensive Computations na thread principal","Técnicas de otimização de desempenho para aplicativos React","Melhoria da eficiência do aplicativo com React"],"ru":["Использование мемоизации с помощью useMemo","Оптимизация списков с помощью техник фильтрации и сортировки","Избежание ненужных повторных рендеров","Дорогие вычисления на основном потоке","Техники оптимизации производительности для приложений React","Улучшение эффективности приложения с помощью React"],"ar":["استخدام التذكير مع useMemo","تحسين القوائم باستخدام تقنيات التصفية والترتيب","تجنب إعادة الترجمة غير الضرورية","الحسابات المكلفة في الخيط الرئيسي","تقنيات تحسين الأداء للتطبيقات رياكت","تحسين كفاءة التطبيق مع رياكت"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use react-performance","react-performance optimization techniques","react-performance vs react-optimization","react-performance setup guide","what is react-performance","react-performance install","react-performance alternative","react-performance best practices","react-performance tutorial","react-performance examples"],"zh":["React性能优化","memoization","useMemo","React渲染行为","React列表优化","React表格优化","减少重新渲染","React开发","React性能设置"],"ja":["Reactパフォーマンス最適化","メモ化","useMemo","Reactレンダリングの動作","Reactリスト最適化","Reactテーブル最適化","再レンダリングの削減","React開発","Reactパフォーマンス設定"],"ko":["React 성능 최적화","메모화","useMemo","React 렌더링 동작","React 목록 최적화","React 테이블 최적화","재렌더링의 감소","React 개발","React 성능 설정"],"es":["react performance","optimización de rendimiento","memoización","optimización de listas","evitación de re-renders","computaciones en segundo plano","herramientas de ai para react","agentes de ia para desarrollo web"],"fr":["react performances","optimisation de performances","mémorisation","optimisation de listes","évitement de re-renders","calculs en arrière-plan","outils d''ia pour react","agents d''ia pour développement web"],"de":["react-leistung","leistungsoptimierung","memoisierung","liste-optimierung","vermeidung von re-renders","hintergrundberechnungen","ai-tools für react","künstliche intelligenz agenten für webentwicklung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho react","memoização react","otimização de lista react","react performance optimization","react memoization","react list optimization","desempenho react","react otimização","técnicas de otimização react"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности react","мемоизация react","оптимизация списка react","react производительность оптимизация","react мемоизация","react список оптимизация","производительность react","react оптимизация","техники оптимизации react"],"ar":["تحسين أداء رياكت","التذكير رياكت","تحسين القائمة رياكت","رياكت أداء تحسين","رياكت التذكير","رياكت قائمة تحسين","أداء رياكت","رياكت تحسين","تقنيات تحسين رياكت"]}},"owner":"CJHarmath","repo":"claude-agents-skills","repoPath":"CJHarmath/claude-agents-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.406Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-performance","description":"Performance optimization for React web applications. Use when optimizing renders, implementing virtualization, memoizing components, or debugging performance issues.","bodyPreview":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a,","body":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)\n    .slice(0, 100);\n}, [items]);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Recalculates every render\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = items\n  .filter(item => item.active)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Memoizing simple access (overhead > benefit)\nconst userName = useMemo(() => user.name, [user.name]);\n```\n\n**When to use useMemo:**\n- Array transformations (filter, sort, map chains)\n- Object creation passed to memoized children\n- Computations with O(n) or higher complexity\n\n### useCallback - Stable Function References\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable callback for child props\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  setSelectedId(id);\n}, []);\n\n// Pass to memoized child\n<MemoizedItem onClick={handleClick} />\n\n// ❌ WRONG: useCallback with unstable deps\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  doSomething(unstableObject); // unstableObject changes every render\n}, [unstableObject]); // Defeats the purpose\n```\n\n**When to use useCallback:**\n- Callbacks passed to memoized children\n- Callbacks in dependency arrays\n- Event handlers that would cause child re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: React.memo\n\n```typescript\n// Wrap components that receive stable props\nconst ItemCard = memo(function ItemCard({\n  item,\n  onSelect\n}: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div onClick={() => onSelect(item.id)}>\n      <h3>{item.name}</h3>\n      <p>{item.price}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\n// Custom comparison for complex props\nconst ItemCard = memo(\n  function ItemCard({ item, onSelect }: Props) {\n    // ...\n  },\n  (prevProps, nextProps) => {\n    // Return true if props are equal (skip re-render)\n    return (\n      prevProps.item.id === nextProps.item.id &&\n      prevProps.item.price === nextProps.item.price\n    );\n  }\n);\n```\n\n**When to use React.memo:**\n- List item components\n- Components receiving stable primitive props\n- Components that render frequently but rarely change\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Components that always receive new props\n- Simple components (overhead > benefit)\n- Root-level pages\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: List Virtualization\n\nFor long lists, render only visible items using react-window or react-virtualized.\n\n```typescript\nimport { FixedSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VirtualizedList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const Row = ({ index, style }: { index: number; style: React.CSSProperties }) => (\n    <div style={style}>\n      <ItemCard item={items[index]} />\n    </div>\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <FixedSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={80}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </FixedSizeList>\n  );\n}\n\n// Variable height items\nimport { VariableSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VariableList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const getItemSize = (index: number) => {\n    return items[index].expanded ? 200 : 80;\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <VariableSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={getItemSize}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </VariableSizeList>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**When to virtualize:**\n- Lists with 100+ items\n- Complex item components\n- Scrollable containers with many children\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Zustand Selector Optimization\n\n**Problem:** Selecting entire store causes re-render on any state change.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useAppStore();\n// or\nconst { items, loading, filters, ... } = useAppStore();\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Only re-renders when selected values change\nconst items = useAppStore((s) => s.items);\nconst loading = useAppStore((s) => s.loading);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Multiple values with shallow comparison\nimport { useShallow } from ''zustand/react/shallow'';\n\nconst { items, loading } = useAppStore(\n  useShallow((s) => ({\n    items: s.items,\n    loading: s.loading\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Avoiding Re-Renders\n\n### Object/Array Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: New object every render\n<ChildComponent style={{ padding: 10 }} />\n<ChildComponent config={{ enabled: true }} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable reference\nconst style = useMemo(() => ({ padding: 10 }), []);\nconst config = useMemo(() => ({ enabled: true }), []);\n\n<ChildComponent style={style} />\n<ChildComponent config={config} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Or define outside component\nconst style = { padding: 10 };\n\nfunction Parent() {\n  return <ChildComponent style={style} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Children Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Inline function creates new element each render\n<Parent>\n  {() => <Child />}\n</Parent>\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable element\nconst child = useMemo(() => <Child />, [deps]);\n<Parent>{child}</Parent>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Code Splitting\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react'';\n\n// Lazy load components\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Dashboard''));\nconst Settings = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Settings''));\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>\n      <Routes>\n        <Route path=\"/dashboard\" element={<Dashboard />} />\n        <Route path=\"/settings\" element={<Settings />} />\n      </Routes>\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}\n\n// Named exports\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() =>\n  import(''./pages/Dashboard'').then(module => ({\n    default: module.Dashboard\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Debouncing and Throttling\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMemo } from ''react'';\nimport { debounce, throttle } from ''lodash-es'';\n\n// Debounce - wait until user stops typing\nfunction SearchInput({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (query: string) => void }) {\n  const debouncedSearch = useMemo(\n    () => debounce(onSearch, 300),\n    [onSearch]\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <input\n      type=\"text\"\n      onChange={(e) => debouncedSearch(e.target.value)}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Throttle - limit how often function runs\nfunction InfiniteScroll({ onLoadMore }: { onLoadMore: () => void }) {\n  const throttledLoad = useMemo(\n    () => throttle(onLoadMore, 1000),\n    [onLoadMore]\n  );\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleScroll = () => {\n      if (nearBottom()) {\n        throttledLoad();\n      }\n    };\n\n    window.addEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n  }, [throttledLoad]);\n\n  return <div>...</div>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Image Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// Lazy load images\n<img\n  src={imageUrl}\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n  alt=\"Description\"\n/>\n\n// With intersection observer for more control\nfunction LazyImage({ src, alt }: { src: string; alt: string }) {\n  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n  const imgRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      ([entry]) => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          setIsVisible(true);\n          observer.disconnect();\n        }\n      },\n      { rootMargin: ''100px'' }\n    );\n\n    if (imgRef.current) {\n      observer.observe(imgRef.current);\n    }\n\n    return () => observer.disconnect();\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={imgRef}>\n      {isVisible ? (\n        <img src={src} alt={alt} />\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"placeholder\" />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Next.js Image component (if using Next.js)\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n\n<Image\n  src={imageUrl}\n  alt=\"Description\"\n  width={400}\n  height={300}\n  placeholder=\"blur\"\n  blurDataURL={blurHash}\n/>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Web Workers for Heavy Computation\n\n```typescript\n// worker.ts\nself.onmessage = (e: MessageEvent<{ data: number[] }>) => {\n  const result = heavyComputation(e.data.data);\n  self.postMessage(result);\n};\n\n// Component\nfunction DataProcessor({ data }: { data: number[] }) {\n  const [result, setResult] = useState(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const worker = new Worker(new URL(''./worker.ts'', import.meta.url));\n\n    worker.onmessage = (e) => {\n      setResult(e.data);\n    };\n\n    worker.postMessage({ data });\n\n    return () => worker.terminate();\n  }, [data]);\n\n  return result ? <Results data={result} /> : <Loading />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Detecting Re-Renders\n\n### React DevTools Profiler\n\n1. Open React DevTools\n2. Go to Profiler tab\n3. Click record, interact, stop\n4. Review \"Flamegraph\" for render times\n5. Look for components rendering unnecessarily\n\n### why-did-you-render\n\n```typescript\n// Setup in development\nimport React from ''react'';\n\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n  const whyDidYouRender = require(''@welldone-software/why-did-you-render'');\n  whyDidYouRender(React, {\n    trackAllPureComponents: true,\n  });\n}\n\n// Mark specific component for tracking\nItemCard.whyDidYouRender = true;\n```\n\n### Console Logging\n\n```typescript\n// Quick check for re-renders\nfunction ItemCard({ item }: Props) {\n  console.log(''ItemCard render:'', item.id);\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\nBefore shipping:\n\n- [ ] Large lists are virtualized\n- [ ] List items are memoized with `React.memo`\n- [ ] Callbacks passed to items use `useCallback`\n- [ ] Zustand selectors are specific (not whole store)\n- [ ] Images use lazy loading\n- [ ] Heavy routes are code-split\n- [ ] No inline object/function props to memoized children\n- [ ] Profiler shows no unnecessary re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| List scroll lag | Virtualize list, memoize items |\n| Component re-renders too often | Check selector specificity, memoize props |\n| Slow initial render | Code split, reduce bundle size |\n| Memory growing | Check for event listener cleanup, state accumulation |\n| UI freezes on interaction | Move computation to web worker or defer |\n\n---\n\n## Relationship to Other Skills\n\n- **react-zustand-patterns**: Selector optimization patterns\n- **react-async-patterns**: Proper async handling prevents re-render loops\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:56.151Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React application performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化React应用程序性能的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがReactアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"React 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento de aplicaciones React optimizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un rendimiento d''applications React optimisé.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes React-Anwendungsverhalten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de desempenho de aplicativos React otimizado.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный показатель производительности приложений React.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء تطبيقات React محسّن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to minimize unnecessary re-renders and computations, leveraging techniques like memoization with useMemo, to build high-performance web applications using React.","zh":"赋予代理最小化不必要的重新渲染和计算的能力，利用诸如使用useMemo的记忆化技术，来构建使用React的高性能Web应用程序。","ja":"エージェントが不要な再描画と計算を最小限に抑える能力を与え、useMemoなどのテクニックを利用して、Reactを使用した高性能なWebアプリケーションを構築します。","ko":"에이전트가 불필요한 재렌더링과 계산을 최소화 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, useMemo와 같은 기술을 사용하여 React를 사용한 고성능 웹 애플리케이션을 구축합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a minimizar las renderizaciones y cálculos innecesarios, aprovechando técnicas como la memoización con useMemo, para construir aplicaciones web de alto rendimiento utilizando React.","fr":"Permet aux agents de minimiser les réaffichages et les calculs inutiles, en exploitant des techniques comme la mémorisation avec useMemo, pour construire des applications web haute performance en utilisant React.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, unnötige Neuzeichnungen und Berechnungen zu minimieren, indem Techniken wie Memoisierung mit useMemo genutzt werden, um Hochleistungs-Webanwendungen mit React zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a minimizar re-renderizações e cálculos desnecessários, utilizando técnicas como memoização com useMemo, para construir aplicações web de alto desempenho usando React.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью минимизировать ненужные повторные рендеринги и вычисления, используя такие техники, как мемоизация с useMemo, для создания высокопроизводительных веб-приложений с использованием React.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقليل إعادة التعريف والعمليات غير الضرورية، مستخدمين تقنيات مثل التخزين المُؤقّت مع useMemo، لبناء تطبيقات ويب عالية الأداء باستخدام React."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React component re-renders","Improving list rendering performance","Reducing expensive computations on the main thread"],"zh":["优化React组件重新渲染","提高列表渲染性能","减少主线程上的昂贵计算"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントの再描画を最適化する","リストの描画性能を向上させる","メインスレッドでの高コストな計算を削減する"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트 재렌더링 최적화","리스트 렌더링 성능 향상","메인 스레드의 고비용 계산 줄이기"],"es":["Optimización de renderizaciones de componentes React","Mejora del rendimiento de renderizado de listas","Reducción de cálculos costosos en el hilo principal"],"fr":["Optimisation des réaffichages de composants React","Amélioration des performances de rendu de listes","Réduction des calculs coûteux sur le thread principal"],"de":["Optimierung von React-Komponenten-Neuzeichnungen","Verbesserung der Listendarstellungsleistung","Verringerung teurer Berechnungen im Hauptthread"],"pt":["Otimizar re-renderizações de componentes React","Melhorar o desempenho de renderização de listas","Reduzir cálculos caros na thread principal"],"ru":["Оптимизация перерисовок компонентов React","Улучшение производительности рендеринга списков","Сокращение дорогих вычислений в основном потоке"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة تعريف مكونات React","تحسين أداء عرض القوائم","تقليل العمليات المكلفة في الخيط الرئيسي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of React''s rendering behavior","Limited to React applications only"],"zh":["需要了解React的渲染行为","仅限React应用程序"],"ja":["Reactの描画動作の理解が必要","Reactアプリケーションのみに限定"],"ko":["React의 렌더링 동작을 이해해야 함","React 애플리케이션만 해당"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del comportamiento de renderizado de React","Limitado a aplicaciones React solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du comportement de rendu de React","Limité aux applications React uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis des Renderingsverhaltens von React","Begrenzt auf React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do comportamento de renderização do React","Limitado a aplicações React apenas"],"ru":["Требует понимания поведения рендеринга React","Ограничен только приложениями React"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم سلوك تعريف React","محدود بتطبيقات React فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e2dffa4237f1554cae41c3b4d13cc3658b649bfdd82b4c27f4720be4ca0a23a2","qualityScore":39}');
