dependencias de mods","Compatibilidad con Fabric y NeoForge"],"fr":["Mise à jour des versions de Minecraft et des dépendances","Ajout de nouveau contenu tel que des boss, des structures et des objets","Préparation pour les lancements","Ajout de nouvelles dépendances de mods","Compatibilité avec Fabric et NeoForge"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Minecraft- und Abhängigkeitsversionen","Hinzufügen von neuem Inhalt wie Chefs, Strukturen und Objekten","Vorbereitung für Veröffentlichungen","Hinzufügen von neuen Mod-Abhängigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit Fabric und NeoForge"],"pt":["Atualização de versões do Minecraft","Gerenciamento de dependências","Preparação para lançamentos","Adição de novos chefes, estruturas e itens","Suporte a Fabric e NeoForge"],"ru":["Обновление версий Minecraft","Управление зависимостями","Подготовка к релизам","Добавление новых боссов, структур и предметов","Поддержка Fabric и NeoForge"],"ar":["تحديث إصدارات ماینكرافت","إدارة الاعتماديات","التحضير للإصدارات","إضافة رؤساء جدد وهياكل وأشياء","دعم Fabric و NeoForge"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use doc-maintenance","doc-maintenance setup guide","Minecraft mod documentation automation","doc-maintenance alternative","doc-maintenance vs other Minecraft mods","automating documentation updates for Minecraft mods","doc-maintenance install","what is doc-maintenance","doc-maintenance for Fabric and NeoForge"],"zh":["Minecraft 依赖版本更新","Doc-Maintenance 设置","Fabric 和 NeoForge","AI 工具","Minecraft 项目文档维护","自动文档更新"],"ja":["Minecraft 依存関係バージョン更新","Doc-Maintenance セットアップ","Fabric と NeoForge","AI エージェント","Minecraft プロジェクトのドキュメント維持","自動的なドキュメント更新"],"ko":["Minecraft 종속성 버전 업데이트","Doc-Maintenance 설정","Fabric와 NeoForge","AI 에이전트","Minecraft 프로젝트 문서 유지","자동 문서 업데이트"],"es":["doc-maintenance","herramientas de AI","Minecraft","Fabric","NeoForge","actualización de versiones","documentación","desarrollo de mods"],"fr":["doc-maintenance","outils d''IA","Minecraft","Fabric","NeoForge","mise à jour de version","documentation","développement de mods"],"de":["doc-maintenance","KI-Tools","Minecraft","Fabric","NeoForge","Versionen-Update","Dokumentation","Mod-Entwicklung"],"pt":["doc-maintenance","Minecraft","atualização de documentação","gerenciamento de dependências","lançamentos","Fabric","NeoForge","desenvolvimento de jogos"],"ru":["ИИ Агент doc-maintenance","Minecraft","обновление документации","управление зависимостями","релизы","Fabric","NeoForge","разработка игр"],"ar":["أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي doc-maintenance","ماینكرافت","تحديث الوثائق","إدارة الاعتماديات","الإصدارات","Fabric","NeoForge","تطوير الألعاب"]}},"owner":"ksoichiro","repo":"ChronoDawn","repoPath":"ksoichiro/ChronoDawn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-maintenance","description":"Guide documentation updates when changing versions, adding content, or preparing releases","bodyPreview":"# Documentation Maintenance\n\n**Purpose**: Guide documentation updates when changing versions, adding content, or preparing releases.\n\n**How it works**: This skill is automatically activated when you mention tasks related to:\n- Updating Minecraft or dependency versions\n- Adding new bosses, structures, or items\n- Preparing for a release\n- Adding new mod dependencies\n\nSimply describe what you want to do, and Claude will reference the appropriate checklist from this skill.\n\n---\n\n## Version Update Ch","body":"# Documentation Maintenance\n\n**Purpose**: Guide documentation updates when changing versions, adding content, or preparing releases.\n\n**How it works**: This skill is automatically activated when you mention tasks related to:\n- Updating Minecraft or dependency versions\n- Adding new bosses, structures, or items\n- Preparing for a release\n- Adding new mod dependencies\n\nSimply describe what you want to do, and Claude will reference the appropriate checklist from this skill.\n\n---\n\n## Version Update Checklist\n\n**When to use**: Updating Minecraft version, mod loader versions, or dependency versions\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **gradle.properties**\n   - Update version properties\n   - Example: `minecraft_version=1.21.1`\n\n2. **README.md** (lines ~47-50)\n   - Section: \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Update all version numbers\n\n3. **docs/player_guide.md** (lines ~25-56)\n   - Sections: \"Prerequisites\" and \"Required Dependencies\"\n   - Update version numbers and download links\n\n4. **docs/developer_guide.md** (lines ~32-45)\n   - Section: \"Key Technologies\"\n   - Update version specifications\n\n5. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~125-128)\n   - Section: \"Technical Details\" → \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Update version numbers\n\n6. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~30-39)\n   - Sections: \"Requirements\" (both Fabric and NeoForge)\n   - Update version numbers\n\n7. **fabric/src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json**\n   - Update `depends` section version ranges\n   - Update `recommends` section if applicable\n\n8. **neoforge/src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml**\n   - Update `[[dependencies.chronodawn]]` entries\n   - Update `versionRange` fields\n\n9. **THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md**\n   - Update version numbers in \"Runtime Dependencies\" section\n   - Update: Minecraft, Fabric Loader, Fabric API, NeoForge, Architectury API\n   - Update \"Last updated\" date at the bottom\n\n### Current Versions (Reference)\n\n```\nMinecraft: 1.21.1\nFabric Loader: 0.17.3+\nFabric API: 0.116.7+\nNeoForge: 21.1.209+\nArchitectury API: 13.0.8+\n```\n\n**After updating**, update this reference list in this skill file.\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Boss\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new boss enemy to the mod\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **README.md** (lines ~25-31)\n   - Section: \"Boss Enemies\" list\n   - Add: `- Boss Name (description, drops Item Name)`\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Section: \"Boss Battles\"\n   - Add full entry with:\n     - Stats (Health, Attack, Defense)\n     - Abilities (list special attacks)\n     - Strategy (combat tips)\n     - Drops (items dropped)\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~28-35)\n   - Section: \"Powerful Boss Battles\"\n   - Add boss to appropriate category (mini-boss, mid-boss, final boss)\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~105-140)\n   - Section: \"Boss Battles\"\n   - Add boss entry with stats and abilities\n\n5. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/spec.md**\n   - Add to User Stories if boss is critical to progression\n   - Add to Requirements section\n\n6. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md**\n   - Add boss entity definition with complete specifications\n\n7. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/tasks.md**\n   - Add implementation tasks for the boss\n\n### Template\n\n```markdown\n### Boss Name (Category)\n\n**Location**: Structure Name\n\n**Stats**:\n- Health: XXX HP\n- Attack: XX damage\n- Defense: XX armor points\n\n**Abilities**:\n- Ability 1: Description\n- Ability 2: Description\n\n**Strategy**:\n- Tip 1\n- Tip 2\n\n**Drops**:\n- **Item Name**: Description\n- Experience points\n```\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Structure\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new structure to the mod\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **README.md** (lines ~17-24)\n   - Section: \"Major Structures\" list\n   - Add: `- Structure Name (location, description)`\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Section: \"Exploring the Chrono Dawn\" or appropriate section\n   - Add structure description and how to find it\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~22-29)\n   - Section: \"Epic Structures\"\n   - Add structure to the list\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~89-97)\n   - Section: \"Structures\"\n   - Add structure entry\n\n5. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/spec.md**\n   - Add to User Stories if structure is critical\n   - Add to Requirements if needed\n\n6. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md**\n   - Add structure definition (generation rules, loot, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Ultimate Artifact\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new ultimate artifact item\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **README.md** (line ~32)\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\" list\n   - Add: `Item Name (type), Description`\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\"\n   - Add full entry with:\n     - Stats (damage, armor, durability)\n     - Special Ability (detailed description)\n     - Recipe (crafting requirements)\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~41-46)\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\"\n   - Add brief description\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~143-167)\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\"\n   - Add item entry with ability description\n\n5. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md**\n   - Add item definition with complete specifications\n\n### Template\n\n```markdown\n### Item Name (Type)\n\n**Stats**:\n- Stat 1: Value\n- Stat 2: Value\n\n**Special Ability**: **Ability Name**\n- Effect description\n- Usage notes\n\n**Recipe**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n- Ingredient 1\n- Ingredient 2\n- Ingredient 3\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n---\n\n## Updating Content Counts and Lists\n\n**When to use**: Adding or removing biomes, bosses, structures, wood types, or other countable content\n\n**Purpose**: Ensure numeric descriptions (e.g., \"8 unique biomes\", \"4 mid-bosses\", \"three wood types\") remain accurate across all documentation\n\n### Files to Check\n\n1. **README.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count, structure count, wood type count\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\", \"Boss Enemies\" list length, \"Major Structures\" list length\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count (categorized: mini-boss, mid-bosses, final boss), structure count, wood type count\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\", \"three wood types\", mid-boss descriptions (\"4 mid-bosses\")\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count, structure count, artifact count\n   - Look for: \"8 Unique Biomes\", boss list lengths, structure list\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count, structure count, wood type count\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\", boss list, structure list\n\n5. **CLAUDE.md**\n   - Check: Current versions list if content affects version compatibility\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\" in Recent Changes or Active Technologies\n\n### Verification Method\n\nWhen adding/removing content:\n1. Search for numeric descriptions (e.g., \"8\", \"four\", \"4 mid-bosses\")\n2. Verify counts match actual implementation\n3. Update Table of Contents if section counts change\n4. Check for phrases like \"all X\", \"both\", \"each of the Y\"\n\n**Tip**: Use `grep -r \"8 unique biomes\" docs/` to find all occurrences quickly\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Dependency\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new mod dependency (required or optional)\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **gradle.properties**\n   - Add version property if needed\n   - Example: `new_mod_version=1.0.0`\n\n2. **fabric/build.gradle**\n   - Add to `dependencies` section\n   - Use `modImplementation`, `modApi`, or `modCompileOnly` as appropriate\n\n3. **neoforge/build.gradle**\n   - Add to `dependencies` section\n   - Use `modImplementation`, `modApi`, or `modCompileOnly` as appropriate\n\n4. **fabric/src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json**\n   - Add to `depends` (required) or `recommends` (optional)\n   - Specify version range\n\n5. **neoforge/src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml**\n   - Add `[[dependencies.chronodawn]]` entry\n   - Set `type` to \"required\" or \"optional\"\n   - Specify `versionRange`\n\n6. **README.md** (lines ~47-50)\n   - Section: \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Add dependency with version and description\n\n7. **docs/player_guide.md** (lines ~41-56)\n   - Section: \"Required Dependencies\"\n   - Add numbered entry with links to CurseForge and Modrinth\n\n8. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~125-128)\n   - Section: \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Add dependency to the list\n\n9. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~30-39)\n   - Sections: \"Requirements\" (both Fabric and NeoForge)\n   - Add dependency to both loader sections\n\n10. **THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md**\n    - Add new dependency entry to \"Runtime Dependencies\" or \"Development Dependencies\" section\n    - Include: Project name, version, developer/organization, license, URL, license URL\n    - Add license summary if it''s a new license type\n    - Update \"Last updated\" date at the bottom\n    - Research license information from project''s GitHub repository or official page\n\n### Dependency Type Guidelines\n\n- **Required (`depends` / `required`)**: Mod cannot function without it\n- **Optional (`recommends` / `optional`)**: Adds features but not essential\n- **Include in JAR**: Use `include` in Fabric for bundling\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Release Verification\n\n**When to use**: Before creating a release or publishing to CurseForge/Modrinth\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [ ] **Version Consistency**\n  - All documentation files show consistent version numbers\n  - gradle.properties matches documentation\n  - fabric.mod.json and neoforge.mods.toml dependencies match gradle files\n\n- [ ] **Documentation Accuracy**\n  - README.md is accurate and up-to-date\n  - player_guide.md is complete with all features\n  - developer_guide.md reflects current architecture\n  - curseforge_description.md ready for publication\n  - modrinth_description.md ready for publication\n\n- [ ] **Configuration Files**\n  - fabric.mod.json has correct dependencies\n  - neoforge.mods.toml has correct dependencies\n  - All dependency versions are tested and working\n\n- [ ] **Build Verification**\n  - `./gradlew clean build` succeeds for both loaders\n  - JAR files are generated correctly\n  - No build warnings or errors\n\n- [ ] **Testing**\n  - All unit tests pass (`./gradlew test`)\n  - Manual testing completed (see quickstart.md checklist)\n  - Both Fabric and NeoForge builds tested in-game\n\n- [ ] **CHANGELOG** (if using)\n  - CHANGELOG.md exists and is current\n  - All user-facing changes documented\n\n- [ ] **GitHub Repository**\n  - All changes committed and pushed\n  - Branch is up-to-date with main/develop\n  - Tags are ready for release version\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Documentation Files by Purpose\n\n**User-Facing**:\n- `README.md` - Project overview, installation, build instructions\n- `docs/player_guide.md` - Complete gameplay guide\n- `docs/curseforge_description.md` - CurseForge mod page content\n- `docs/modrinth_description.md` - Modrinth mod page content\n\n**Legal**:\n- `LICENSE` - Project license (MIT)\n- `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md` - Dependency licenses and version information\n\n**Developer**:\n- `docs/developer_guide.md` - Development setup and architecture\n- `specs/chrono-dawn-mod/spec.md` - Feature specification\n- `specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md` - Data models\n- `specs/chrono-dawn-mod/tasks.md` - Implementation tasks\n\n**Configuration**:\n- `gradle.properties` - Version definitions\n- `fabric/src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json` - Fabric metadata\n- `neoforge/src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml` - NeoForge metadata\n\n### Common Line Number References\n\n- README.md Dependencies: ~47-50\n- player_guide.md Prerequisites: ~25-56\n- developer_guide.md Technologies: ~32-45\n- curseforge_description.md Requirements: ~125-128\n- modrinth_description.md Requirements: ~30-39\n- README.md Boss List: ~25-31\n- README.md Structure List: ~17-24\n\n---\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Always update in pairs**: When updating Fabric configs, update NeoForge configs too\n2. **Test both loaders**: Changes to dependencies affect both Fabric and NeoForge differently\n3. **Use search**: Use `grep` or IDE search to find all occurrences of version numbers\n4. **Keep CLAUDE.md current**: Update the current versions list after major updates\n5. **Commit frequently**: Commit documentation changes separately from code changes\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-08 (Added THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md to maintenance checklists)\n**Maintained by**: Chrono Dawn Development Team\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:57.363Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Minecraft Modding Agents requiring automated documentation updates for Fabric and NeoForge projects.","zh":"适用于需要为Fabric和NeoForge项目自动更新文档的Minecraft Modding Agents。","ja":"FabricとNeoForgeプロジェクトの自動ドキュメント更新が必要なMinecraft Modding Agentsに適しています。","ko":"Fabric와 NeoForge 프로젝트를 위한 자동 문서 업데이트가 필요한 Minecraft Modding Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de modificación de Minecraft que requieren actualizaciones de documentación automatizadas para proyectos de Fabric y NeoForge.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modification de Minecraft nécessitant des mises à jour de documentation automatisées pour les projets Fabric et NeoForge.","de":"Ideal für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die automatisierte Dokumentationsaktualisierungen für Fabric- und NeoForge-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Modding do Minecraft que requerem atualizações de documentação automatizadas para projetos Fabric e NeoForge.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов моддинга Minecraft, требующих автоматических обновлений документации для проектов Fabric и NeoForge.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعدلين لمinecraft الذين يتطلبون تحديثات وثائقية آلية لمشاريع Fabric و NeoForge."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate documentation updates for Minecraft modders, supporting tasks like version updates and release preparations using checklists for tasks such as updating Minecraft or dependency versions, adding new content, and preparing releases.","zh":"赋予代理人自动更新Minecraft模组文档的能力，支持版本更新和发布准备等任务，使用更新Minecraft或依赖版本、添加新内容和发布准备等任务的检查清单。","ja":"Minecraftモッダー向けにドキュメントの自動更新を可能にし、チェックリストを使用してMinecraftまたは依存関係のバージョンを更新したり、新しいコンテンツを追加したり、リリースの準備をしたりするタスクをサポートします。","ko":"Minecraft 모더를 위한 문서 자동 업데이트를 가능하게 하며, 체크리스트를 사용하여 Minecraft 또는 의존성 버전을 업데이트하거나 새 컨텐츠를 추가하거나 릴리스 준비 등의 작업을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las actualizaciones de documentación para los modders de Minecraft, admitiendo tareas como actualizaciones de versiones y preparaciones de lanzamiento utilizando listas de verificación para tareas como la actualización de Minecraft o versiones de dependencias, agregar nuevo contenido y preparar lanzamientos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les mises à jour de documentation pour les moddeurs de Minecraft, en prenant en charge des tâches telles que les mises à jour de version et les préparatifs de sortie en utilisant des listes de vérification pour des tâches telles que la mise à jour de Minecraft ou des versions de dépendances, l''ajout de nouveau contenu et la préparation des sorties.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dokumentationsaktualisierungen für Minecraft-Modder zu automatisieren, indem es Aufgaben wie Versionsaktualisierungen und Vorbereitungen von Veröffentlichungen mithilfe von Checklisten für Aufgaben wie die Aktualisierung von Minecraft oder Abhängigkeitsversionen, das Hinzufügen von neuen Inhalten und die Vorbereitung von Veröffentlichungen unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as atualizações de documentação para criadores de mods de Minecraft, apoiando tarefas como atualizações de versão e preparação de lançamentos usando listas de verificação para tarefas como atualizar o Minecraft ou versões de dependência, adicionar novo conteúdo e preparar lançamentos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать обновления документации для создателей модов Minecraft, поддерживая задачи, такие как обновления версий и подготовка к выпуску, используя чек-листы для задач, таких как обновление Minecraft или версий зависимостей, добавление нового контента и подготовка к выпуску.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير تحديثات وثائقية آلية لمطوري mods لمinecraft، ودعم المهام مثل تحديثات الإصدار والاستعداد للنشر باستخدام قوائم التحقق من المهام مثل تحديث Minecraft أو إصدارات التبعيات وإضافة محتوى جديد والاستعداد للنشر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating version update checklists for Minecraft mods","Generating documentation for new mod dependencies","Preparing release notes with updated mod information"],"zh":["自动更新Minecraft模组的版本更新检查清单","为新模组依赖项生成文档","使用更新的模组信息准备发布说明"],"ja":["Minecraftモッドのバージョン更新チェックリストを自動更新する","新しいモッド依存関係のドキュメントを生成する","更新されたモッド情報でリリースノートを準備する"],"ko":["Minecraft 모드의 버전 업데이트 체크리스트 자동 업데이트","새 모드 의존성에 대한 문서 생성","업데이트된 모드 정보로 릴리스 노트 준비"],"es":["Automatización de listas de verificación de actualizaciones de versiones para mods de Minecraft","Generación de documentación para nuevas dependencias de mods","Preparación de notas de lanzamiento con información de mods actualizada"],"fr":["Automatisation des listes de vérification des mises à jour de version pour les mods de Minecraft","Génération de documentation pour les nouvelles dépendances de mods","Préparation des notes de sortie avec des informations de mods mises à jour"],"de":["Automatisierung von Checklisten für Versionsaktualisierungen von Minecraft-Mods","Generierung von Dokumentationen für neue Mod-Abhängigkeiten","Vorbereitung von Veröffentlichungshinweisen mit aktualisierter Mod-Information"],"pt":["Automatizar listas de verificação de atualização de versão para mods de Minecraft","Gerar documentação para novas dependências de mods","Preparar notas de lançamento com informações de mod atualizadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать чек-листы обновления версий для модов Minecraft","Генерировать документацию для новых зависимостей модов","Подготавливать заметки о выпуске с обновленной информацией о моде"],"ar":["توفير قوائم التحقق من تحديث الإصدار للmods لمinecraft","генерировать وثائق للتبعيات الجديدة للمods","تجهيز ملاحظات الإصدار مع معلومات المود المحدّثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Minecraft modding with Fabric and NeoForge","Requires activation through specific task-related descriptions"],"zh":["仅限于Fabric和NeoForge的Minecraft模组","需要通过特定任务相关描述激活"],"ja":["FabricとNeoForgeのMinecraftモッディングに特有","特定のタスク関連の説明を介してアクティブ化する必要がある"],"ko":["Fabric와 NeoForge의 Minecraft 모딩에 특정","특정 작업 관련 설명을 통해 활성화해야 함"],"es":["Específico para la modificación de Minecraft con Fabric y NeoForge","Requiere activación a través de descripciones de tareas específicas"],"fr":["Spécifique à la modification de Minecraft avec Fabric et NeoForge","Nécessite une activation via des descriptions de tâches spécifiques"],"de":["Spezifisch für die Modifizierung von Minecraft mit Fabric und NeoForge","Erfordert Aktivierung über bestimmte, aufgabenbezogene Beschreibungen"],"pt":["Específico para modding do Minecraft com Fabric e NeoForge","Requer ativação por meio de descrições de tarefas específicas"],"ru":["Конкретно для моддинга Minecraft с Fabric и NeoForge","Требует активации через конкретные описания задач"],"ar":["محدد لمعدل Minecraft مع Fabric و NeoForge","يتطلب تفعيلًا من خلال وصفات任务 محددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"dbe8e117d7887acb86f2b81d30de994a1732f20327b271d7073704bbf243668c","qualityScore":39}');
